        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Products: Taken for Granted, Montagues and Capulets, Party Like a Russian\n- People: Sia, Nigel Corsbie, Sergei Prokofiev\n- Concepts: songwriting, production, sampling, classical music\n\nFacts:\n- Sergei Prokofiev wrote \"Montagues and Capulets,\" which is a work of classical music.\n- Sia wrote \"Taken for Granted.\"\n- Nigel Corsbie produced \"Taken for Granted.\"\n- \"Taken for Granted\" heavily samples Sergei Prokofiev's \"Montagues and Capulets.\"\n- The chorus of \"Party Like a Russian\" samples Sergei Prokofiev's \"Montagues and Capulets.\"",
